---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="New Opportunities — PyOrex HUB">
<section class="opp"><div class="wrap"><a class="back" href="/hub">← PyOrex HUB</a><div class="eyebrow">PROJECTS · DEALS · GROUND · CAPITAL</div><h1>New<br/>Opportunities</h1><p class="lead">A filtered watchlist of new exploration opportunities: project acquisitions, farm-ins, option agreements, new ground, financings and strategic moves with geological relevance.</p><div class="filters"><span>PERU & ANDES</span><span>GOLD</span><span>COPPER</span><span>JUNIORS</span><span>EARLY STAGE</span></div><div class="rule"></div><section class="panel"><span>OPPORTUNITY WATCH</span><h2>Signal, not promotion.</h2><p>Items will be screened for jurisdiction, commodity, deposit model, project stage, transaction type and geological rationale. Company announcements remain attributed to their original source; PyOrex will separate reported facts from interpretation.</p></section></div></section>
</Base>
<style>.opp{min-height:760px;padding:75px 0;background:radial-gradient(circle at 80% 10%,#2a3027,#071216 46%)}.back{display:inline-block;color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;margin-bottom:55px}.opp h1{font-size:clamp(64px,8vw,110px);line-height:.82;letter-spacing:-.065em;margin:20px 0 28px}.lead{font-size:20px;line-height:1.6;color:#bdc7c9;max-width:820px}.filters{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:28px}.filters span{border:1px solid var(--line);padding:8px 11px;font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.12em}.rule{height:1px;background:var(--line);margin:55px 0 32px}.panel{max-width:850px;border-left:2px solid var(--gold);padding:5px 0 5px 28px}.panel>span{font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.14em;color:var(--gold)}.panel h2{font-size:30px;margin:13px 0}.panel p{color:var(--muted);line-height:1.7}</style>